# Hand-authored specification documents. Prettier reflows their tables and swaps emphasis
# markers, which makes every edit a diff full of noise. They are prose, not code.
#
# **Listed here and in `.prettierrc.json`** (`P-357`). Prettier reads this file only from the
# directory it runs in, so run from `packages/web` it judged `docs/TASKS.md` and flagged it,
# while from here it skipped it. The config is found by walking up from the file, so its
# `requirePragma` override for these paths gives the same answer from anywhere: not formatted
# unless a file asks with `@format`, which none does.
docs/
